  "details": "In most games, L2 is generally mapped to the same functionality as MOUSE2.\n\nFor VRChat specifically, this allows users to much more easily throw things by moving the camera with the right stick and pressing L2 to let go of them, similar to what a mouse user can easily do.\n\nWith the current bindings (Circle / B or Square / X to throw/let go), it is very difficult to move the camera at the same time as throwing.",
